----------------------------------------------------------
Supporting Changes
----------------------------------------------------------

The original handout uses older JPA (javax.persistence)
imports. Since Spring Boot 3 uses Jakarta EE, the project
was implemented using jakarta.persistence annotations.

The MySQL table was created using the column names:

code
name

The entity class was updated accordingly so that the JPA
mapping matches the actual database schema.

